From 32c6637dfbf177c3624997d1d217218c7032ffc0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 00:18:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Wild Pokemon before the League at the League's levels

Routes 26 and 27, Tohjo Falls and Victory Road had wild Pokemon at
Lv. 17-41, though the trainers there bring a team to about Lv. 50; under
the scaled experience formula they gave too little for a player to make
up a gap before the Elite Four. Their grass, cave, surfing and Rock Smash
levels move into Lv. 45-50, keeping their order, and Pokemon past a plain
level-up evolution appear evolved. Fishing is unchanged. Generated by
tools/hack/league_wild.py.
---
